# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# This is a placeholder. yt-dlp will find no useful cookies here, which
# is fine for development on a residential IP.
#
# In production (on a data-center IP like AWS/GCP), YouTube blocks
# requests with "Sign in to confirm you're not a bot." To bypass that,
# replace this file with a real cookies export from a logged-in
# browser session. See DEPLOY.md section "YouTube cookies file" for
# step-by-step instructions.
